Error [E0367]: pattern `Green` needs a leading `.`
  --> tests/ui/enum_pattern_needs_dot_or.jet:9:16
    |
  9 |         .Red | Green -> { print("warm") }
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: match patterns take a leading dot so the name isn't read as a variable or call (D-ENUMDOT1)
 Fix: write `.Green`
